#. Used in the browser
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"CrowdSec resolves the AS and country itself, in the "
"{crowdsecurity_geoip_enrich} parser on the machine that raised the alert. "
"The LAPI never computes them, it stores whatever the agent sent. Install "
"that parser on the reporting machine and these alerts start carrying "
"{as_name}, {as_number} and {cn}."
msgstr ""
"CrowdSec löst AS und Land selbst auf, im Parser {crowdsecurity_geoip_enrich} "
"auf der Maschine, die den Alert ausgelöst hat. Die LAPI berechnet sie nie, "
"sie speichert, was der Agent gesendet hat. Installiere diesen Parser auf der "
"meldenden Maschine, dann enthalten diese Alerts {as_name}, {as_number} und "
"{cn}."

#. Used in the browser
msgid ""
"CrowdSec returned as many alerts as the cap allows, so older ones are not "
"counted here. Raise CROWDSEC_ALERT_LIMIT, or the alert limit in Settings, to "
